msgctxt "92"
msgid "You mean you were really kidnapped by yakuza? What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Well, they took me to this hotel where there was this fat bald guy waiting "
"for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "And then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"He pushed me down on the bed and ran his hands all over my shoulders and "
"lower back. Then he just started massaging me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Oh god... I'm so sorry to make you remember all of this again..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Well, actually, he was a really good masseuse. It kinda hurt at first, but "
"after a minute or so, it started to feel really good..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "You're kidding!"
msgstr "Stai scherzando!"

